*> The sulfur cube archetypes of 20 section 18.2 (002-lane-p49n; core/src/mob-20-sulfur.cob), in the order of the table there. One row per archetype of the registry sulfur_cube_archetype; an
*> archetype's item tag is minecraft:sulfur_cube_archetype/<name> of the item registry (the members are data). SA-BUOYANT 1 when the cube floats; SA-FUSE and SA-POWER the explosion data (fuse in ticks,
*> power in blocks, 0 = none; the fire flag is false for the only explosive one); SA-CONTACT-MILLI the contact damage in thousandths (sulfur_cube_hot, 0 = none). SA-KBRES, SA-EXPL-KBRES, SA-BOUNCE,
*> SA-FRICTION and SA-DRAG are the attribute modifiers in thousandths: knockback resistance and explosion knockback resistance, bounciness (add_value), friction modifier and air drag modifier
*> (add_multiplied_total); nothing in the core reads them yet (their use on movement was not traced, 18.2).
